  "question": {
    "text": "A body hanging from a spring stretches it by <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>1&nbsp;</mn><mtext>cm</mtext></math> at the earth's surface. How much will the same body stretch the spring at a place <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>1600&nbsp;</mn><mtext>km</mtext></math> above the earth's surface? (ans in cm) (Radius of earth <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6400&nbsp;</mn><mtext>km</mtext></math> )"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "0.64",
  "solution": {
    "text": "In equilibrium, weight of the body = stretching force<br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> At the earth's surface, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msup><mrow><mtext>mg</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mtext>k</mtext><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>6400</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>6400</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1600</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>1&nbsp;</mn><mtext>cm</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0.64&nbsp;</mn><mtext>cm</mtext><mtext></mtext></math>"
  }
